CM END-FED HALF-WAVE (EFHW) MULTIBAND WITH 49:1 UNUN
CM Purpose: Demonstrate EFHW multiband operation (80M, 40M, 20M)
CM Antenna: 135-foot EFHW at 50-foot end height
CM Balun: FT-240-43, 3:21 turns (49:1 impedance transformation)
CM Counterpoise: 20-foot element, 10 feet high
CM Expected: Impedance varies across band (tuner required/simulated)
CE
